sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as UI (CLI/OpenWebUI)
  participant FR as FlowRunner
  participant SS as SessionStore
  participant RB as Registry+Builder
  participant FL as Flow
  participant IN as Tools/MCP/LLM
  participant HPC as HPC Systems

  UI->>FR: User request
  FR->>SS: get_or_create(session)
  FR->>RB: Resolve/build flow
  RB-->>FR: Flow instance
  FR->>FL: execute(input)
  FL->>IN: model/tool/MCP calls
  IN->>HPC: Query/update (as needed)
  HPC-->>IN: Results
  IN-->>FL: Grounded context
  FL-->>FR: FlowOutput(content, metadata)
  FR->>SS: Persist interaction
  FR-->>UI: Response (sync/stream)
